<description>&lt;p&gt;Venancio Mondlane remains on trial for terrorism linked to the 2024 election protests, while Islamist militants of Ansar al-Sunna continue attacking civilians in Cabo Delgado, limiting humanitarian access. MSF reports that barriers in Macomia impede aid delivery to affected populations. The insurgency’s focus on civilian targets sustains security pressures alongside the political trial. 151 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNdzFZS0FiVlptY3lqLVZIZEhCOGNZekdZYzJXd2dST09tNlcxaEU0Q3EwUTNrclZqVnQ4Ty1UVENhUEw3QmktWlJacDY3VlNkQVBKZDFNRG9jUlVuVmsyY3ljUXVZd2xrSDdSR05RR2diOFFHbFZTOWw3RjBFTXZhMXVERDc5ZnAySlpBb0JnWXpVV0Q2OGU3WkVMUENjN1g1eUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOYzZLWVVaYnoyLW9zbS00X2VSNFFYdXJVVEc3TDBUVXpfS0UwR2YyLVlMcnFtd0FkME53dURtTlFLakVJWVJ6ajBOaHdrUGNuT2dFWENsLVRWUXdyRVZlV3NGOEt0MUxGQjVuUXhfYjc5a2d0ZnMzbllNZVFmY0NwX1E3RE54M1RFUWNKN3hPMUk1QVIyMUxEekdR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQckZNbS1pZzY5dG5oU1hQOXNiV08yUW44UE9YN1pzWjNPaDlYRTVuaElyUmY0VVRsSnN1dXFTVGJ1LVotS3RfVmFDOXJOWUZ5SjVWZUs5bF9YNVJ4VHFhM0llWHpDQ3FRalBwMXhBR0FtNDdDMGdfNThBbmliRzlvemZFTmJsTHBrR1ExWllYb1BXbEZ5OUJDUw?oc=5&quot;&gt;AfricaSoccer.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQYUhYcmVYOXpVUVE2MWJhY3pkNDEyUkVQM0ItUWNaT2NuelliTi1aMUZqOVN1RnR1M1c5MUlXNDJJNWZkTnNsNnQxSERBRHRGc0ZOdWNmVmVXZURsWERNNGxfMHZ3N0VHT1gyLTF1UGNRci0yY2xaZXVUMVJ2NnlOMS1VenpCZWUtZUo4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Meer | English edition&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE9kS0FJcjN1UXZycnNoT1E1dE1KeVRZZk1HSE11Y1pCbUZMOWowaXZXa1BYcHVTbEtjT21ha2J3WGNFelN